sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Frontend (React)
    participant Bot as Telegram Bot
    participant API as API (FastAPI)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Frontend: Navigate to /support
    Frontend->>Frontend: Show Telegram bot deep link<br/>?start=support + QR
    User->>Bot: Open Telegram<br/>Send /support command
    Bot->>User: Ask for question text
    User->>Bot: Send question (10-256 chars)
    Bot->>Bot: Validate + format message
    Bot->>Admin: Forward to ADMIN_CHAT_ID<br/>with user ID + username
    Admin->>Bot: Reply to message<br/>or /reply command
    Bot->>User: Forward reply
    Admin->>Bot: /logs command<br/>(view recent messages)
    Bot->>Admin: Show recent support<br/>interactions

    Note over API: POST /api/support exists but<br/>is unused by frontend
